          "text": "You should",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Say, \"I need space,\" don't look at the door",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "\"I hate you\" means \"I need you more\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "If I say, \"Go have fun, babe,\" that's just short for",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
